[{"id":4300759371,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAFhhSw","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"4d4a92f56b82c74bcd297bfc20832d9e172039db","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?u=ccfc0c8ff4c980eb77e097aa72e9ad04749294a9&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","login":"YeldhamDev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev"},"body":"Fixes the issue.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119247#pullrequestreview-4300759371","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119247","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-15T19:15:06Z"},{"id":4430015512,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCAysGA","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"4d4a92f56b82c74bcd297bfc20832d9e172039db","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"I don't think the current `clamp_to_embedder` is correct. Currently you can have an embedded window where you can drag it outside of its embedding window, but resizing the parent window moves it back into view, which is a strange behavior. It was intended that \"windows that are clamped to their embedder are now automatically shifted/resized on popup, and when the parent is resized.\" (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/75141#issuecomment-1483656600), but in `Viewport::_set_size` it never checked if the child had `clamp_to_embedder`. \r\n\r\nSo I don't think `clamp_to_embedder` is intended to have a different purpose, and the properties should be merged into one.\r\n\r\n- Also see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99946","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119247#pullrequestreview-4430015512","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119247","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-06-04T17:34:56Z"}]